> id16(x:f16)=x
> ab16(x:f16)=abs(x)
> fl16(x:f16)=floor(x)
> equ16(x:f16)=x*1
> sq16(x:f16)=sqrt(x*x)
> equiv id16 ~ ab16
id16 and ab16 differ at 31743 points, e.g. x=-65504: -65504 vs 65504
> equiv id16 ~ fl16
id16 and fl16 differ at 49152 points, e.g. x=-1023.5: -1023.5 vs -1024
> equiv id16 ~ equ16
id16 and equ16 are equal on the domain of id16 (exhaustive)
> equiv id16 ~ sq16
id16 and sq16 differ at 47103 points, e.g. x=-65504: -65504 vs inf
